# Build using the official AOMP scripts ("delegating" to them).

# Build tasks in this file are mostly auto-generated, using an "ao" prefix
# to distinguish them from components that don't use the wrapped scripts.
# We don't use "aomp" because that causes name conflicts with the
# aomp/aomp_extras modules.

